# run-status.mmd — plan_run 状态机

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending
    pending --> running: worker picked
    pending --> cancelled: user cancel
    running --> completed: persist commit + all required nodes success
    running --> degraded: fallback result persisted
    running --> failed: hard failure + rollback
    running --> cancelled: user cancel / timeout cancel
    completed --> [*]
    degraded --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
```

## 合法转移矩阵

| From | To | 触发条件 | 副作用 |
|---|---|---|---|
| pending | running | Worker / Service 接管 run 并启动 LangGraph | run.started_at 写入 |
| pending | cancelled | 用户在执行前取消 | run.finished_at 写入 |
| running | completed | persist 节点 commit + 全部必要节点 success | run.finished_at 写入；final_plan_id 填充 |
| running | degraded | 降级结果已持久化（如 agent max_rounds_exhausted） | run.finished_at + fallback_reason |
| running | failed | 任一 hard failure（如 plan 事务回滚） | run.finished_at + fallback_reason |
| running | cancelled | 用户取消或服务端取消超时 run | run.finished_at + fallback_reason |

## 非法转移响应

| 转移尝试 | 响应 |
|---|---|
| completed/failed/degraded/cancelled → running | 409 STATE_RUN_ALREADY_FINISHED |
| completed → failed | 409 STATE_RUN_ALREADY_FINISHED |
| 任一终态 → pending | 409 |

## 校验位置

- Pydantic：`schemas/agent_run.py` 用 `@model_validator` 守
- Service：`services/agent_run.py::assert_can_transition()`

